# An extension's request never closes a prompt, a dialog or a typed query (#269; foundations,
# "Unsaved work is never taken away"). tests/drive.rs installs the open-tasks example patched
# to send workspace/open for Krakatoa whenever the tasks change, before it shows its count.
# Each task another program writes makes it ask: a new note's name being typed, a new name, a
# rename's plan and a command typed in the palette each stay, with the reason on the status
# line, and the user's own Enter still does what it did. The palette with nothing typed holds
# no work, so the note is opened then.
size 140x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
env COLD_LAVA_TODAY=2026-11-07
wait-for ☐ 16 open tasks
keys n
wait-for new note · Tab template · ⏎ create · Esc cancel
type Half a thought
wait-for name: Half a thought▏
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] One\n
wait-for ☐ 17 open tasks
wait-for open-tasks wanted to open Volcanoes/Krakatoa.md: not while a new note's name is being typed
expect name: Half a thought▏
screen
keys enter
wait-for Concepts/Half a thought  reading
keys R
wait-for rename · ⏎ preview · Esc cancel
keys ctrl+u
type Whole thought
wait-for new name: Whole thought▏
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] One\n- [ ] Two\n
wait-for ☐ 18 open tasks
wait-for open-tasks wanted to open Volcanoes/Krakatoa.md: not while a new name is being typed
expect new name: Whole thought▏
keys enter
wait-for Concepts/Half a thought.md  →  Concepts/Whole thought.md
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] One\n- [ ] Two\n- [ ] Three\n
wait-for ☐ 19 open tasks
wait-for open-tasks wanted to open Volcanoes/Krakatoa.md: not while a rename waits for your answer
expect Concepts/Half a thought.md  →  Concepts/Whole thought.md
screen
keys enter
wait-for renamed to Concepts/Whole thought.md
keys :
wait-for ↑↓ choose · ⏎ run · Esc close
type rescan the
wait-for rescan the▏
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] One\n- [ ] Two\n- [ ] Three\n- [ ] Four\n
wait-for ☐ 20 open tasks
wait-for open-tasks wanted to open Volcanoes/Krakatoa.md: not while a command is being typed
expect rescan the▏
keys esc
wait-gone rescan the▏
wait-gone open-tasks wanted to open
keys :
wait-for ↑↓ choose · ⏎ run · Esc close
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] One\n- [ ] Two\n- [ ] Three\n- [ ] Four\n- [ ] Five\n
wait-for ☐ 21 open tasks
wait-for Volcanoes/Krakatoa  reading
expect-not open-tasks wanted to open
screen
keys esc
wait-for ? help  q quit
keys q
exits 0
